# Frontend build-time configuration (Vite). Copy to .env.local for local overrides.
#
# Production (Vercel): the public URL of the Django API, no trailing slash.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://securegate-api.onrender.com
# Leave it EMPTY for local development so requests go through the Vite dev
# proxy (see vite.config.ts) to the Django server on http://127.0.0.1:8010
# (start it with: python manage.py runserver 127.0.0.1:8010).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Optional: where the dev proxy forwards /api, /media and /static.
# VITE_DEV_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8010
